# Netlify route rewrites.
#
# Incident detail uses a wildcarded URL but a single static HTML
# template — the incident id is read from the URL client-side and
# the matching incident is found in the public status envelope at
# api.folaform.com. Rewrite every /incidents/<id> request to the
# placeholder page so it resolves with a 200.
/incidents/*  /incidents/_placeholder.html  200
